 - TCP only. UDP is delegated to `udp_outbound`; it is not multipath-aggregated.
+- Logical `CLOSE` currently represents whole-connection shutdown; independent TCP half-close (`CloseWrite` while continuing to read) is not modeled as a separate wire state yet.
